# Neon + Vercel

## Neon

- Postgres is required from day one — do not add local-only ephemeral DB shortcuts that skip Neon.
- Prefer the **pooled** connection string for serverless (`DATABASE_URL`).
- Schema changes belong in `db/migrations/` (and historical Supabase SQL under `supabase/migrations/` until fully consolidated).
- Neon Auth trusted domains must include local (`http://localhost:5173`) and production (`https://myfitnesslogger.vercel.app`).

## Vercel

- Keep `vercel.json` SPA rewrites: `/api/*` and `/neon-auth/*` must not be swallowed by `index.html`.
- Frontend env vars prefixed with `VITE_` are build-time — set them on Vercel for Production/Preview.
- After infra changes, smoke-test `GET /api/health`.

## Secrets

- Store runtime secrets in Vercel project env and local `.env.local` only.
- Rotate any Neon API key that was shared in chat once setup is confirmed.
